            "detailed_description": "Gender Bender DNA Twister Extreme is a crazy visual novel that follows a cast of characters that have their genders flipped due to unforeseen and ridiculous circumstances. Pick a character from a massive cast and follow their unique stories as they find romance and experience a range of outrageous transformations. <br><br>Features<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Thirteen Playable Characters, with unique NPCs, love interests and endings<br></li><li>An ongoing storyline that evolves with each new playable character<br></li><li>Early routes are modelled after dating sims, with the player presented with a number of choices to choose from<br></li><li>Later routes feature playable puzzle sections, courtroom investigation scenes and full on adventure game sections<br></li><li>Approximately 40 Hours Of Content. In total the game is over 375,000 words long <br></li><li>Over 40 unique NPCs and Characters, not counting all of the ridiculous transformations<br></li><li>Dozens of ridiculous transformations! Snake girls, mermaids, sentient blobs of slimes...<br></li><li>Great reviews from players!</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "Gender Bender DNA Twister Extreme is a crazy visual novel that follows a cast of characters that have their genders flipped due to unforeseen and ridiculous circumstances. Pick a character from a massive cast and follow their unique stories as they find romance and experience a range of outrageous transformations. <br><br>Features<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Thirteen Playable Characters, with unique NPCs, love interests and endings<br></li><li>An ongoing storyline that evolves with each new playable character<br></li><li>Early routes are modelled after dating sims, with the player presented with a number of choices to choose from<br></li><li>Later routes feature playable puzzle sections, courtroom investigation scenes and full on adventure game sections<br></li><li>Approximately 40 Hours Of Content. In total the game is over 375,000 words long <br></li><li>Over 40 unique NPCs and Characters, not counting all of the ridiculous transformations<br></li><li>Dozens of ridiculous transformations! Snake girls, mermaids, sentient blobs of slimes...<br></li><li>Great reviews from players!</li></ul>",
            "short_description": "The ultimate cult classic gender bender romantic comedy! Play through 13 massive chapters, each with their own unique protagonist. Swap genders, turn into a slime monster, become a mermaid! It's Gender Bender DNA Twister Extreme!",
